<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">- Cishingini Agwara Kambari [asg]</book>
  <para style="h">HAGAI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hag</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hagai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Katagarda ka Hagai</para>
  <para style="mt2">Katagarda ka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hagai</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuɓa̱yuwa̱</para>
  <para style="ip">Katagarda ka Hagai ki ta̱ uɗiki n akaka a gbati-gbati a na keneki Hagai u ciya̱i a̱ ubuta̱ u Vuzavaguɗu a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka amangatawantawun n kamanga (520) kafu a matsa Yesu (KY). Cina ɗe uma a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ ubuta̱ u tsugbashi o bonoi o yongoi a Urushelima a̱ya̱ kenu, ama A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a, a buwa ta̱ ufa̱di. Akaka a, a zuwa ta̱ aza e kelime a uma a maꞋasaka A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin. Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin uzuwakpani u kulyaꞋa ku kelime n kuciya̱ ku ma̱ta̱na̱ a kubana, u uma a na a sabaꞋi nwalu n le, ɗa o bonoi ciɗa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na yi punu udari</para>
  <para style="io1">E nekei kadanshi a maꞋasaka A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin 1:1-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Akaka a̱ uka̱ni u ka̱ɗu n kukeɗe a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱ 2:1-23</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAG 1" />
  <para style="s1">Uneki u kadanshi a maꞋasaka A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 1:1" />A kanna ka iyain ko wotoi u ta̱li, a̱ ka̱ya̱ ke ire ko tsugono tsu Dariyu, Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin kadanshi n keneki Hagai, udanai, yaꞋan kadanshi n Zerubabelu kolobo ka Shiyatiyelu, gomuna vu Yahuda, n Jesuwa kolobo ka Jehozadaku ganu vu gbayin.<verse eid="HAG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 1:2" />Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u danai i ɗanna, &lt;&lt;Uma a nampa a danai, &lt;Ka̱ta̱ ayin a yawa a na a kumaꞋasaka A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a Vuzavaguɗu ba.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="HAG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 1:3" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin kadanshi n keneki Hagai, u danai. <verse eid="HAG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 1:4" />&lt;&lt;Yi ene ta̱ u gaꞋan ta̱ a makyan ma nampa i yongo a iꞋuwa i singai-singai, ka̱ta̱ i ka̱sukpa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin okpo agali?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HAG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 1:5" />Gogo na i na Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u danai i ɗanna, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱i ukuna u ɗa̱! <verse eid="HAG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 1:6" />I ci ca̱Ꞌa̱ ta̱ n a̱bunda̱i, ama ka̱ta̱ i kucikpa i kyaꞋa kenu. I ci lyaꞋa ta̱ ilikulyaꞋa, ama i ci cuwa̱ ba. I tsu soꞋo ta̱ mini, ama ma ci yawa ɗa̱ ba. I tsu uka ta̱ ntogu, ama n ɗa n tsu pala ɗa̱ uta̱ni ba. Aza a na a ci isa katsupu, adanshi i ta̱ a ku zuwa sa ikebe ya o nsolo n na n ta̱sa̱i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HAG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 1:7" />Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u danai i ɗanna, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱i ukuna u ɗa̱! <verse eid="HAG 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 1:8" />Kumbai a gaɗi vu nsasan ka̱ta̱ i tuka̱ nu nɗanga adama a na a maꞋasaka kpaꞋa ka, ciya̱ m pana uyoꞋo u ku ɗa, ka̱ta̱ kpamu n ciya̱ tsugbayin ɗe. <verse eid="HAG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 1:9" />I tsu zuwa ta̱ a̱ɗu yi ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ n a̱bunda̱i, ama ɗa kucikpa i ciya̱i kenu. Kenu vu na i tuka̱i a kpaꞋa, n tsu uvula̱ ta̱ i ɗa i laza, yiɗa̱i i zuwai nannai? Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u danai, adama a kpaꞋa ku va̱ ku na i ka̱sukpa̱i agali ɗa, ama yaba dem vu ɗa̱ wi ta̱ a kataci ka kumaꞋa kpaꞋa ku ni. <verse eid="HAG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 1:10" />Ɗaɗa i zuwai gaɗi u sa̱nka̱i n ciza, iɗika kpamu i kpa̱ɗa̱i kumatsa ili. <verse eid="HAG 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 1:11" />N tuka̱i n uɗekpu a iɗika ya, n ubuta̱ wa aginda, n ashina a ilya, n ashina a itacishi, nu nɗanga n zaitu, n ili i na i tsu uta̱ a iɗika, ali n uma nu nnama dem, koɓolo n ulinga we ekiye u ɗa̱ feu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HAG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uma o tonoi wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 1:12" />Ɗa Zerubabelu kolobo ka Shiyatiyelu, n Jesuwa kolobo ka Jehozadaku ganu vu gbayin, koɓolo n uma a na a buwai dem, o tonoi kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le, ɗa kpamu ushuki n kadanshi ka̱ ni ka na Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le u suki u keneki Hagai. Ɗa uma a a panai wovon u Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="HAG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 1:13" />Ɗa Hagai, vuza vu usuki vu Vuzavaguɗu, u danai uma akaka a, u danai, &lt;&lt;Mpa Vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ koɓolo n a̱ɗa̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HAG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 1:14" />Ta Vuzavaguɗu u saꞋwai ka̱ɗu ka Zerubabe kolobo ka Shiyatiyelu, gomuna vu Yahuda, n Jesuwa kolobo ka Jehozadaku, ganu vu gbayin nannai, n uma a na a buwai dem. A̱ ta̱wa̱i ɗa a̱ gita̱i ulinga u kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili, Ka̱shile ke le. <verse eid="HAG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 1:15" />A̱ gita̱i ulinga a kanna ka kamanga n ka̱ na̱shi ko wotoi u ta̱li, a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ ka̱ya̱ ke ire ko tsugono tsu Dariyu.<verse eid="HAG 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAG 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tsugbayin tsa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a savu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 2:1" />A kanna ka kamanga n kete ko wotoi u cindere, ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin kadanshi n keneki Hagai, u danai, <verse eid="HAG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 2:2" />&lt;&lt;YaꞋan kadanshi n Zerubabe kolobo ka Shiyatiyelu, gomuna vu Yahuda n Jesuwa kolobo ka Jehozadaku, ganu vu gbayin, koɓolo n uma a na a buwai dem, vu ece le, <verse eid="HAG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 2:3" />&lt;Yayi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ ɗa̱ u buwai n wuma ali ɗa u ciya̱i we enei kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu n tsugbayin ci ni ci cau? Nini ɗai yi e kene ku ɗa gogo na? E kene ku ɗa̱ ili i yoku i ɗa ba? <verse eid="HAG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 2:4" />Ama gogo na tsurukpa, avu Zerubabe, tsurakpa, avu Jesuwa kolobo ka Jehozadaku, ganu vu gbayin. Tsurukpai a̱ɗa̱ uma a iɗika ya, Vuzavaguɗu u danai. YaꞋin ulinga, adama a na mpa Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili mi ta̱ koɓolo n a̱ɗa̱. <verse eid="HAG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 2:5" />A ayin a na yi uta̱i a iɗika i Masar n yaꞋanka ɗa̱ ta̱ uzuwakpani n danai, ayinviki a̱ va̱ i ta̱ o kuyongo n a̱ɗa̱, ta kaꞋa ki nannai ali n anana, adama a nannai ka̱ta̱ i pana wovon ba.&gt; <verse eid="HAG 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 2:6" />Na ɗa ili i na Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u dansai, mi e kugeshe ba, mi ta̱ a̱ kugba̱ɗa̱ gaɗi n aduniyan m mala n iɗika i ɗekpu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:26">A Ib 12:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HAG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 2:7" />Mi ta̱ kpamu a̱ kugba̱ɗa̱ uma aduniyan ra̱ka̱, ka̱ta̱ a̱ tuka̱ n uciyi u le ra̱ka̱ a kpaꞋa ku va̱. Mi ta̱ a kushatangu kpaꞋa ku nampa n tsugbayin. Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u dansai. <verse eid="HAG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 2:8" />Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u danai, azanariya n azurufa a̱ va̱ a ɗa. <verse eid="HAG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 2:9" />Tsugbayin tsu kpaꞋa ku savu ku nampa kulaꞋa ku cau, Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u danai. A̱ ubuta̱ u nampa mi ta̱ a̱ ku tuka̱ n una̱singai m ma̱ta̱na̱, Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u dansai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HAG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Una̱singai adama aza a usuɓi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 2:10" />A kanna ka kamanga n ka̱ na̱shi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko wotoi u kuci, a̱ ka̱ya̱ ke ire ko tsugono tsu Dariyu, ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin kadanshi n keneki Hagai. <verse eid="HAG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 2:11" />&lt;&lt;Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u danai i ɗanna, &lt;Ecei anan ganu ili i na wila̱ u danai. <verse eid="HAG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 2:12" />Vuza yoku u ka̱ta̱la̱ baci inyama i na yi ciɗa o motogu ma̱ ni, ɗa motogu ma ma saꞋwai boroji, ko ili i kulyaꞋa ko ma̱kya̱n ko maniꞋin ko icuꞋu yi ilikulyaꞋa dem, na lo wi ta̱ a kuzuwa ili ya yi okpo ciɗa?&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:12">Ɗa anan ganu a̱ ushuki a danai, &lt;&lt;A̱Ꞌa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HAG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 2:13" />Ɗa Hagai u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuza u natukpa baci ka̱ci ka̱ ni a̱ ubuta̱ u kusaꞋwa keven ki ikyamba, ali ɗa kpamu u saꞋwai ili i te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ki nampa ka, nanlo va wi ta̱ a kuzuwa ili i nanlo ya yi okpo n unata?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:13">Ɗa anan ganu a danai, &lt;&lt;Ili ya yi ta̱ o ko okpo n unata.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HAG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 2:14" />Ɗa Hagai wu ushuki le u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u dana ta̱, &lt;Ta kaꞋa ki nannai u uma a nampa n uduniyan u na wi kelime ka̱ va̱, n ulinga we ekiye u le dem, n ili i na i e kuneke yi ta̱ n unata. <verse eid="HAG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 2:15" />Gogo na la̱na̱i kuyongo ku ɗa̱ ili i na i ɗikai na a kubana kelime. Kafu i kiyangu katali a gaɗi vu vutoku a kumaꞋa A̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu, niniɗai kuyongo ku ɗa̱ ki. <verse eid="HAG 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAG 2:16" />I tsu bana ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kotoro ki ili i kashina n i danai yi ta̱ a̱ ku kunzuku kagisamkpatsu kamanga, ama kucukpa i cina kagisamkpatsu kupa koci. I tsu bana ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kupisha ma̱kya̱n n kusheshe ku na i kuciya̱ punu edele amangatawun a̱ ma̱diki, ama kucukpa i cina punu edele amangere koci. <verse eid="HAG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAG 2:17" />Vuzavaguɗu u danai, n tuka̱i ɗa̱ n wunla̱i wu usuɗukpi ɗa u zuwai ica̱Ꞌa̱shi ya ashina i ɗa̱ i lumbai n kerepu, m mini ma akpanga ma na ma̱ la̱nga̱sa̱i ashina a̱ ɗa̱, n nannai dem i bono wa̱ va̱ ba.&gt; <verse eid="HAG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAG 2:18" />La̱na̱i, kuyongo ku ɗa̱ gogo na a kubana kelime, ili i na i ɗikai a kanna ka kamanga n ka̱ na̱shi ko wotoi kuci, kanna ka na a varai kumaꞋa ka̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a gbayin a Vuzavaguɗu. N ciga ta̱ i sheshe mayin a ukuna u keci ku nampa. <verse eid="HAG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAG 2:19" />I buwa n icuꞋu i kuca̱Ꞌa̱ o mpon n ɗa̱ ba, ili i na i ɗikai ayin a na i ca̱Ꞌi. Gogo na ashina a itacishi, nu nɗanga mu mbiri, nu nɗanga n zaitu n ɗa̱, i o kudoku kumatsa umaci u gbani-gbani kpamu ba. Ama ili i na i ɗikai a kanna ka nanlo ali a kubana n kelime, mayun mi ta̱ a kuzuwaka ɗa̱ una̱singai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HAG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋankai Zarubabelu uzuwakpani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAG 2:20" />Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin kadanshi n keneki Hagai kakawa kure, a kanna ka kamanga n ka̱ na̱shi ko wotoi u kuci, u danai, <verse eid="HAG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HAG 2:21" />&lt;&lt;Dana Zerubabelu gomuna vu Yahuda, mi ta̱ a̱ kugba̱ɗa̱ gaɗi n iɗika. <verse eid="HAG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HAG 2:22" />Mi ta̱ a kutakpa tsugono ci iɗika kakau, mi ta̱ kpamu a̱ kula̱nga̱sa̱ ekeke o odoku mu una akumbi e le, odoku i ta̱ a̱ kuyikpa̱ akumbi e le kpamu i ta̱ a ku unanai n otokobi. <verse eid="HAG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HAG 2:23" />Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u danai, a kanna ka nanlo, mpa mi ta̱ a kuɗika wu, Zerubabe kolobo ka Shiyatiyelu kagbashi ka̱ va̱, mi ta̱ o kubonoko wu tsu ka̱ta̱mba̱ri ka̱ va̱, tsu na mogono ma ci yaꞋan ulinga n ka̱ta̱mba̱ri ko tsugono ci ni, adama a na n zagba wu ta̱, Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili u dansai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HAG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 2" />
</usx>